Aujar for Debian/Ubuntu
=======================

After installing this package, you need to enable and start the services:

    systemctl --user enable --now aujar.service aujar-ui.service

This will:
- Start the Aujar daemon (background service)
- Start the Aujar launcher UI
- Allow you to use Ctrl+Alt+Space to show the launcher

If you don't enable the services, running `aujar launcher toggle` or
clicking the Aujar desktop icon will result in "No launcher UI is subscribed".

---

Alternatively, you can use the install-local.sh script for a fully automatic
setup (recommended for most users):

    ./scripts/install-local.sh

This script handles building, installing, and enabling everything.
